legacy/hip3 retains the original Python source, tests, configuration and documentation.
The Rust aggregation implements the upstream independence-group weighted median,
MAD filtering and quorum concepts with the differences documented in docs/ARCHITECTURE.md.
The Solidity contracts, Rust EVM publisher, dashboard and local integration tooling
are added by this project. No affiliation with or endorsement by Hyperliquid is implied.

Aegis Oracle Live 0.2 adds Coinbase, Kraken and Bitstamp native USD trade
adapters, source-time normalization, bounded HTTP retry/backoff, and opt-in
live market evidence. Public portfolio repository: seasonHxy/aegis-oracle-live.
